trust: Config tripwire repair
gosum: go.sum residue triage
mutations: 3x mutation receipts
docsdet: json/v2 determinism rows + gotchas
changelog: schema-builder Added entry
readme: metaengine README verify
p1root: 4% root-causes (badger + queue flake + art-dupl provenance)
lsmpins: LSM MapUpdate pins x3
capdrift: engine-capabilities drift
p20docs: 20% docs pack (godoc + semantics + cookbook + sweep)
census: SchemaEvent fleet census
recipe: stored-bytes recipe
verify: composed verify-chain attempt
report: final table report

trust -> gosum -> mutations -> docsdet -> changelog -> readme
readme -> p1root
p1root -> lsmpins -> capdrift
capdrift -> p20docs -> census -> recipe -> verify -> report
mutations -> lsmpins
